<title>USA: Dell Computer added to S&amp;P 500 Index.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer added to S&amp;P 500 Index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Thursday it will replace Varity Corp in the S&amp;P 500 Index with Dell Computer Corp after the close of trading on September 5, 1996.</p>
<p>Varity Corp is merging with the British company Lucas Industries Plc to form LucasVarity Plc, which also will be a British company.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange expects trading in Varity to be suspended before the opening of trading on September 6.</p>
<p>Dell, a member of the S&amp;P MidCap 400, will be replaced in the index by PMI Group Inc, Standard &amp; Poor's said.</p>
</text>
